From 0d695b266ecae223b7b58c5f818972aa14cc95c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JSwetz <Johnswetz1982@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 05:33:09 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(app): apply start-side entry law on create and keep
 explicit entry edits

Extend OpParams::with_start_side_entry to take a named_entry flag.

When named_entry is true, do not replace the user entry choice.

Apply with_start_side_entry on CreateOperation against seed parameters.

Support with_named_entry in EditOperationParams and CreateOperation.

Detect explicit entry choices in MCP add_operation and edit_operation.

Pin with tests in offset_pass_start::start_side_entry.

Fixes #3863
