Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(recipe): keep explicit entry on cut recipe apply

ApplyCutRecipe now calls CreateOperation with named_entry set to true.
This change prevents the start-side law from changing an entry in a recipe.
Undo and redo in the MCP edit module use standard control flow.
Pinned by cut_recipe_keeps_explicit_helix_on_start_side_offset.

